uld be lurking in the darkness...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dLxCJnozs011L5wOscMFYnAGmi7.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Another day, another exciting morning for the School Living club! It's summertime, and Yuki is ready to finish her last tutoring session with Megu and start enjoying summer break. She's ready for all the summer traditions, like the beach, fireworks, and of course, a test of courage! She's eager to get her fellow club members to brave the school at night, but you never know what could be lurking in the darkness...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dLxCJnozs011L5wOscMFYnAGmi7.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10697","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20754","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24765","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63495","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"283946","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"39398","synopsis":"The power's out and everyone's bummed about not being able to cook or shower...at least until Yuki cheerfully suggests camping out! The girls pitch tents in the classroom and stay up talking late into the night. Meanwhile, Megu thinks back to the day where it all began...where everyone's definition of a normal day changed forever.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ie9vje12uHcnLrpcMgS9Uq1150l.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"The power's out and everyone's bummed about not being able to cook or shower...at least until Yuki cheerfully suggests camping out! The girls pitch tents in the classroom and stay up talking late into the night. Meanwhile, Megu thinks back to the day where it all began...where everyone's definition of a normal day changed forever.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ie9vje12uHcnLrpcMgS9Uq1150l.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10697","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20754","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24765","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63495","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"283946","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"39399","synopsis":"Yuki is practically bouncing off the walls after coming up with an idea to take a field trip outside the school grounds. Rii-san and Kurumi remind her that club members aren't supposed to leave the grounds, but Yuki's convinced that if it's a school-sponsored activity they won't be breaking the rules. Their destination: the mall! Take a stroll down memory lane, to the days before the group first met Mii-kun.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1kLA3WVx8QwkY96UWZ00GtqayXN.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Yuki is practically bouncing off the walls after coming up with an idea to take a field trip outside the school grounds. Rii-san and Kurumi remind her that club members aren't supposed to leave the grounds, but Yuki's convinced that if it's a school-sponsored activity they won't be breaking the rules. Their destination: the mall! Take a stroll down memory lane, to the days before the group first met Mii-kun.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1kLA3WVx8QwkY96UWZ00GtqayXN.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10697","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20754","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24765","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63495","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"283946","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"39393","synopsis":"Yuki and the gang begin their \"field trip\" to a mall on the outskirts of town. While raiding the supermarket on the basement for supplies, Kurumi chances upon a puppy... None other than the School Living Club's future mascot, Taromaru! He happily joins the girls as they make their way to the fifth floor, where Mii-kun remains hunkered down.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qGiTGXz3KDTmB5h49w12YmAfmB9.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Yuki and the gang begin their \"field trip\" to a mall on the outskirts of town. While raiding the supermarket on the basement for supplies, Kurumi chances upon a puppy... None other than the School Living Club's future mascot, Taromaru! He happily joins the girls as they make their way to the fifth floor, where Mii-kun remains hunkered down.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qGiTGXz3KDTmB5h49w12YmAfmB9.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10697","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20754","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24765","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63495","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"283946","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"39396","synopsis":"The School Living club has new members! After bringing Mii-kun and Taromaru back from the besieged fort in the shopping mall, Yuki and Megu-nee take them on a grand tour of the school. For a moment, Mii-kun feels like life might just have gone back to normal...especially when Yuki decides to welcome her to the club by holding a field day event!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1GTP74Lgd9TUJvr2WRHM0pFsg0a.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"The School Living club has new members! After bringing Mii-kun and Taromaru back from the besieged fort in the shopping mall, Yuki and Megu-nee take them on a grand tour of the school. For a moment, Mii-kun feels like life might just have gone back to normal...especially when Yuki decides to welcome her to the club by holding a field day event!","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1GTP74Lgd9TUJvr2WRHM0pFsg0a.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10697","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20754","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24765","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63495","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"283946","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"39388","synopsis":"Yuki sits in an after-school study session, working hard on classic lit (one of her worst subjects). Mii-kun stops by to help tutor her senpai, and as she recites from \"An Account of My Hut\" Yuki exclaims that old books are like letters from the past. Inspired, Yuki rounds up the School Living Club and the four girls sit down to pen a message to the world.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r72EdJrFwYWEduK4Qn1l7caIZz0.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Yuki sits in an after-school study session, working hard on classic lit (one of her worst subjects). Mii-kun stops by to help tutor her senpai, and as she recites from \"An Account of My Hut\" Yuki exclaims that old books are like letters from the past. Inspired, Yuki rounds up the School Living Club and the four girls sit down to pen a message to the world.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r72EdJrFwYWEduK4Qn1l7caIZz0.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10697","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20754","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24765","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63495","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"283946","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"39392","synopsis":"A swim in the rooftop \"lake\" leaves Taromaru covered in nasty green algae, leaving Yuki to give him a bath and the rest of the club to take care of her equally dirty laundry. As the four stand under the sun watching the clothes dry, the conversation turns to \"graduation\" and their plans for the future. Later that night, a bout of insomnia leads Mii-kun and Rii-san to search for the lock to Megu-nee's secret key.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4dcb9fGNuzPzfBohrBcEDhostgc.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"A swim in the rooftop \"lake\" leaves Taromaru covered in nasty green algae, leaving Yuki to give him a bath and the rest of the club to take care of her equally dirty laundry. As the four stand under the sun watching the clothes dry, the conversation turns to \"graduation\" and their plans for the future. Later that night, a bout of insomnia leads Mii-kun and Rii-san to search for the lock to Megu-nee's secret key.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4dcb9fGNuzPzfBohrBcEDhostgc.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10697","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20754","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24765","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63495","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"283946","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"39389","synopsis":"What could possibly have possessed Yuki to make her charge into the club room brandishing a deck brush and shouting about cleaning up? The brilliant idea to turn the rooftop lake (a.k.a the water storage tank) into a pool for the day! The girls carefully transfer the lake's fish to buckets, scrub out the algae and pond scum, and let their troubles slip away for the day as they enjoy their new pool.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iOtfbDW0Two0g1OY5ZqHjJdJU4w.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"What could possibly have possessed Yuki to make her charge into the club room brandishing a deck brush and shouting about cleaning up? The brilliant idea to turn the rooftop lake (a.k.a the water storage tank) into a pool for the day! The girls carefully transfer the lake's fish to buckets, scrub out the algae and pond scum, and let their troubles slip away for the day as they enjoy their new pool.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iOtfbDW0Two0g1OY5ZqHjJdJU4w.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"10697","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20754","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"24765","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"63495","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"283946","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"39390","synopsis":"It's pouring rain. The School Living club girls are gathered in the club room, but things take a worrying turn when Taromaru doesn't show up to eat. Yuki and Mii-kun search the club room floor while Kurumi checks the other levels. The shovel-wie